{"metadata": {"team_id": "Organizers", "run_id": "orga-bm25-human", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "6-1_3", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "The CO2 laser works by emitting a specific wavelength of light that targets water molecules in the skin, vaporizing skin cells and making way for fresh, clear new skin. It also penetrates the skin's deeper dermis layer to stimulate new collagen production, which firms and smooths skin over time. The fractional CO2 laser takes the CO2 laser beam and fractionates it into thousands of tiny little shafts of light that penetrate into the deeper layers of the skin, causing the skin to repair those tiny shafts by pushing out the old sun-damaged skin and replacing it with new skin. This process helps to shrink existing collagen and stimulate new collagen production, resulting in smoother, more youthful-looking skin. The laser removes surface cells of the epidermis, making way for fresh, clear new skin, and it can treat a variety of skin concerns, including fine lines and wrinkles, discoloration, acne scars, stretch marks, and uneven skin texture. The laser can also treat benign skin growth", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0004-01-09924:1": 10.468457221984863, "clueweb22-en0032-14-04213:8": 8.16459846496582, "clueweb22-en0031-65-04139:2": 8.018044471740723, "clueweb22-en0004-01-09924:13": 7.90927267074585, "clueweb22-en0004-01-09924:2": 7.685881614685059}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I've noticed dark spots and uneven tone on my face.", "I have visible pores on my cheeks and nose.", "I usually wear makeup to even out my complexion.", "I am a 40-year-old woman.", "I'm interested in treatments that improve my skin with minimal downtime."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0004-01-09924:1": 10.468457221984863, "clueweb22-en0032-14-04213:8": 8.16459846496582, "clueweb22-en0031-65-04139:2": 8.018044471740723, "clueweb22-en0004-01-09924:13": 7.90927267074585, "clueweb22-en0004-01-09924:2": 7.685881614685059, "clueweb22-en0018-50-01341:4": 7.6539793